silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_02_embedded_engine_functor_concrete_anchor_node2 silm:hasLongDescription "The 02_embedded_engine_functorOperationNode is The operation or gate node for 02_embedded_engine_functor. F_EE(VetRecord_Mittens) = engine representation. F_EE(lambda_evidence) = engine aboutness arrow. Both travel together. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Operation or gate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
